            desc = "The reverse requirements on the HDMI input interface timing can be met only when the reverse enable register is ORed with the INIF timing reverse register. bit[22]: VSYNC signal reverse enable. 0: disabled 1: enabled bit[21]: HSYNC signal reverse enable. 0: disabled 1: enabled bit[20]: data valid sync signal reverse enable. 0: disabled 1: enabled bit[19]: reserved bit[18:17]: HDMI video output format select. The default value is 00. The RGB or YCbCr format is selected by configuring the DHD. 00: YCbCr444, 30-bit sync separation mode 01: RGB444, 30-bit sync separation mode 10: YCbCr422, 20-bit sync separation mode 11: YCbCr422, 10-bit sync separation mode bit[16]: HDMI data source. 0: DHD1 output 1: DHD0 output";
